OL,3,GNEWSAFire service improved in most
OL,4,Aareas, says report
OL,5,
OL,6,FA county's fire chief said she was
OL,7,F"disappointed" after an inspection
OL,8,Ffound the service needed to improve its
OL,9,Fresponse.
OL,11,FAn independent watchdog assessed
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire Fire and Rescue
OL,13,FService (NFRS), rating seven out of 10
OL,14,Fareas good.
OL,16,FRoy Wilsher, from His Majesty's
OL,17,FInspectorate of Constabulary and Fire &
OL,18,FRescue Services (HMICFRS), said it had
OL,19,Fmade "considerable progress" and
OL,20,Fpraised its "strong leadership, clear
OL,21,Fstrategic direction and commitment from
OL,22,Fstaff".
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
