OL,3,GNEWSAFire service improved in most
OL,4,Aareas, says report
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief Fire Officer Nikki Watson said:
OL,7,F"It's clear to me that we do respond
OL,8,Fwell to emergencies... [but inspectors]
OL,9,Fwant us to show that we do that
OL,10,Fconsistently."
